Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:23:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): cache and display WCS flip refusals

Reuse the existing post refusal for the WCS note and status. Key the display cache by document revision and active setup. Preserve post validation and generated output.

Co-Authored-By: Coder <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2497
